# Normalize line endings for every text file in the repository.
#
# The index and the repository always store LF. This declaration takes
# precedence over a local `core.autocrlf=true`, so a checkout keeps LF on
# every platform and `gofmt -l .` reports only real formatting problems.
#
# `text=auto` still lets Git detect binary files (e.g. assets/*.png) and
# leave their bytes untouched.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows batch/PowerShell scripts are only consumed by cmd.exe/PowerShell,
# which accept LF, so they are covered by the rule above as well.
